WEBVTT

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:07.400
It's almost Christmas, isn't it?

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.390
I love Christmas!

00:00:10.390 --> 00:00:11.490
Me too!

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:13.460
It's kind of exciting, right?

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:14.260
Yeah!

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:15.450
Huh?

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:17.990
Isn't that Kusuda's seat?

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:23.050
Hey! Why are you sitting in my seat, Sogabe?!

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:24.830
It's hard to see the writing on the board.

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:30.440
Hey, in front of the train station there was this really cute, big tree! You guys see it?

00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:30.880
Oh, really?

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:33.590
How assertive of you.

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:36.340
At this rate, maybe you'll get some by winter break.

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:38.410
Shh! Don't say rude things!

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:41.600
I think the most important thing is just keep her within my sights!

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:43.710
While you have your back turned?

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.990
Men talk with their backs!

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:48.520
A man expressing his love through his back...

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:51.110
I'm sure Chikura-san will understand!

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:54.110
I think your strategy to appeal to her is failing.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.570
Chikura-san's just shy.

00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:02.660
If it was just the two of us together, I'm sure she would talk to me more, laugh more...

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:03.490
I know!

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:05.260
O-Ow! What? What?!

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:06.790
What is it?

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:10.430
If that's the case, we just need to spend Christmas Eve together!

00:01:10.430 --> 00:01:11.490
You can probably meet her

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:12.800
...in your dreams if you wish to, Santa.

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:14.860
Who said I wanted to meet her in my dreams?

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:17.090
I'm talking about reality, damn it!

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:18.260
I-I can't breathe!

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:20.900
If my calculations are correct,

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:23.700
Chikura-san will probably spend Christmas Eve with Enomoto-san and the others!

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:27.180
If we participate in their gathering, I'll see a different Chikura-san than usual!

00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:30.270
Different than usual...

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:12.330
Before the Snow Falls

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:09.500
What? A Christmas party?!

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:13.170
Yup. Wouldn't it be fun to eat good food and party with everyone?

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:15.800
You got some nerve saying that!

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:17.130
Especially with that face. That kappa-face.

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:18.380
Shut up, wrinkly-face!

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:20.380
Zaitsu-kun are you going too?

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:22.140
I'll partici-

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:29.810
Woah! Kusuda-kun, when did you take these?!

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:32.400
If you participate, I'll erase these.

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:36.230
Yes, Zaitsu-kun will be participating!

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:37.070
YES!

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:37.690
Ayumi?

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:39.190
I will go too!

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:40.490
Everyone, let's participate!

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:42.530
Nice, Arihara-san!

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:45.030
Gosh, this girl...

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:46.910
Guess it can't be helped. Count me in.

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:48.950
I'll pass.

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:52.580
"I'm going to spend Christmas with Onii-chan~"

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:55.290
Aw! I wanted to say it myself!

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:58.670
Chikura-chan and Doba-chan, you're both okay right?

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:00.760
Oh, I'll pass too.

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:02.340
Why? Club activites?

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:04.680
It's more like I might have plans.

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:05.180
Probably...

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:08.560
What's that mean? It's not like you have a boyfriend.

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:11.680
What about the essential, most important Chikura-san?

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:14.690
I don't really have any plans,

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:18.190
so if Kei-chan and Ayumi-chan are going, then I guess I'll go.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.730
We did it!

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:21.150
Christmas with Zaitsu-kun!

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:23.780
Christmas with Chikura-san!

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:32.620
{OnScreen}Excitement

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:26.410
It's exactly three boys and three girls!

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:29.490
How about we all do a gift exchange?

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:31.830
That's a great idea! Of course girls give to the guys!

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:32.620
And guys give to the girls!

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:34.710
Right?!

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:36.250
Were those two always that friendly?

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:36.830
Who knows?

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:44.430
So I'm going to spend my Christmas with Kusuda...

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:59.570
"I think they'll be happy to receive a handmade present even if it's not perfect."

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:01.780
High school second year, Akio.

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:08.830
That won't work. It's Kusuda after all, so doing something like that would just lead to more teasing.

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:12.040
I wonder what would be good?

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:16.580
The only things I think he'd like are porno mags and manga, though...

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:22.000
Wait, why am assuming that I'm going to be giving it to Kusuda?

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.260
There's a chance it could be one of the other two boys.

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:29.140
But there's a one-in-three chance I'll be paired with Kusuda, so...

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:33.520
I need something that'll make Kusuda so happy he'll cry and worship me.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:37.140
Thanks so much for giving me something this great!

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:40.900
All I've done up until now is make fun of you! I'm sorry!

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:43.570
Or something like that...

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:48.160
Actually, the reason why I was so mean to you was because...

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:51.240
it was a twisted way of saying that I-I liked you...

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:53.540
Wait, what's with this development?

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.750
There's no way you would like me!

00:05:56.210 --> 00:06:02.250
I'm cold to you. Plus, we don't suit each other at all!

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:05.800
But you must care about me because you're seeing these delusions!

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:08.590
Men are all about faces! Their face is everything!

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:11.260
Gazing at me with those rotten eyes, I'll...

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:14.520
If you look at me like that, I-I'll...

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:17.140
O-Onee-chan...

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:19.900
What're you doing naked, Kei-chan?

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:31.410
I'll never accept this!

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:37.080
I'm a woman who was proposed to by a man with an annual income of 13 million yen!

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:39.000
But despite that...

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:47.170
Why is my chest throbbing for... for a guy that's ugly inside and out?

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:50.430
This really is the worst.

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:54.430
Ayumi-chan, did you buy your Christmas present yet?

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:57.350
Not yet, but I should start thinking about that soon, shouldn't I?

00:06:57.350 --> 00:06:58.270
You're right.

00:06:58.270 --> 00:06:58.810
I know! Chikura, let's go shopping for presents together!

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:01.230
Oh, yeah. What should I do about the present?

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:09.530
After thinking about it...

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:13.530
this is the first time in my life that I'll be giving a guy a present.

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:15.530
Though I've received a mountain of stuff.

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:18.450
This is cute.

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:22.210
But guys wouldn't be happy about receiving this.

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:27.840
This color would suit the plain Kusuda.

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:32.680
I've never seen him wear a scarf, so I think this might be good.

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:36.760
Wait, why the hell is Kusuda here?!

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:40.940
D-Did you come to get a present too?

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:42.520
Is that bad?!

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:43.810
More importantly, what's that?

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:46.360
There's no way a guy would wear a scarf that flashy!

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:47.900
They would!

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:50.320
Have you ever thought about being fashionable before?

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:52.240
If not, then don't complain about it.

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:54.780
You're getting gloves?

00:07:55.320 --> 00:08:01.210
Oh, how surprising. I thought you'd pick out some perverted lingerie or something.

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:02.790
You're even more perverted than me.

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:06.130
I was just thinking like you!

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:08.170
There's no way I would buy something like that.

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:12.220
If it was you, it wouldn't matter, but I might get paired with Chikura or Arihara.

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:16.970
You really do think like an old man, Enomoto.

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:21.350
Why does he treat Chikura and Ayumi like girls?

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:23.270
But I'm...

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:26.190
But I'm...

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:28.440
Enomo-

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:32.900
Do you seriously think that a girl would be happy getting such lame gloves?

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:36.910
If I got those pink gloves, I'd immediately throw them away.

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:39.740
Plus, you got those from the clearance bin too, didn't you?

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:42.790
I can't believe you would buy on-sale items for a present.

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:45.710
You don't understand a girl's feelings at all!

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:50.000
Wait!

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:52.170
Hey...

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.180
Kusuda!

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:56.470
Kusuda!

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:03.480
What should I do? I hurt his feelings...

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:12.780
It's cold!

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:14.900
Crap, I'm going to be late.

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:22.540
Sup.

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:24.870
Oh, good morning.

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:28.460
Good. Seems like he isn't mad about yesterday.

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:30.460
Hey, Kusuda.

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:50.820
What's with those socks?

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:52.320
Worst timing ever.

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:56.070
I was planning on apologize about yesterday too...

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:02.830
It's not like I'm being ignored.

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:06.370
But it's still unusual.

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:15.130
Why did I say such mean things?

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:29.600
I should have apologized back then.

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:38.360
Kusuda-kun, give back my test!

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:42.450
As time passes, it feels like it's too late,

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:44.790
...and makes it even harder.

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:48.410
Enomoto!

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:50.080
Ow!

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:52.330
What was that for, Dobashi?!

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:54.300
You've been slouching recently, so...

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:56.010
Girl, you're too buff!

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:58.380
Oh, so you can spit out your usual abuses.

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:03.100
Worrying about something doesn't suit a princess like you.

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:04.930
I'm not really worrying about anything.

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:06.310
That's good then.

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:10.730
It's not a big deal.

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:15.440
I was just thinking if it's right to spend Christmas with them...

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:19.200
Christmas... huh?

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:20.650
What?

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:22.870
Do you have something to worry about too?

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:26.200
Dobashi-san!

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:35.000
What's up?

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:38.550
Sorry to bother you when you're going home with your friend...

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:40.090
but can I borrow you for a bit?

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:41.930
Who's this?

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:43.180
A guy from my club.

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:46.220
There's something I need to talk to you about!

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:49.230
Sorry, but I'm going to walk home with him.

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:49.810
What?

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:50.180
See ya.

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:55.690
Huh? Did Dobashi...

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:00.490
laugh just now?

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:12.790
More importantly, the problem's that Christmas party!

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:16.460
I don't want to go if the mood stays this way.

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:24.430
They dropped...

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:25.680
Kei-chan, Kei-chan!

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:26.220
What?!

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:29.060
If it's about the report card, I'm not going to show you!

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:30.850
No, it's not about that.

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:34.350
Have you decided what you're wearing for the Christmas party?

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:35.980
Not yet.

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:38.820
Can I claim pink clothes then?

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:41.360
Claim? Why don't you just wear what you want.

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:44.410
I don't want to match what you wear.

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:45.610
Match me?

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:48.200
Well, you like pink after all.

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:54.000
Does everyone around me think I like pink?

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:58.540
Of course! You have lots of pink things.

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:03.760
Like your pencil box, notebooks, scarf, and that hair tie you have in your hair...

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:13.390
Could it be, those gloves...

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:17.730
were for me?

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:21.860
But there's no way that's possible.

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:26.860
Still, what kind of face am I supposed to put on when I see him?

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:40.500
Anyway, I'll go with a smile!

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:43.960
Instead of being awkward, I have be natural, normal, and nonchalant.

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:56.020
Sorry!

00:13:57.440 --> 00:13:59.020
Am I the last one?

00:13:59.900 --> 00:14:01.150
Guess not.

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:02.690
Y-Yeah...

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:08.860
It's rare seeing Ayumi and Chikura being so late.

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:10.530
That's the thing...

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:18.670
While we were waiting, Santa passed out...

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:26.090
Zaitsu-kun said he was going to carry him to the hospital.

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:28.430
Zaitsu-kun, over here!

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:38.940
Somehow, Zaitsu-kun's rescuing spirit was burning with passion.

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:40.850
So Ayumi went with him?

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:42.860
Oh, my cell?

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:44.860
It's Chikura.

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:47.030
Hello?

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:48.780
H-Hello?

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:51.320
I think I caught a cold...

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:57.000
I was really excited about today, but...

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:58.370
I'm really sorry!

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:00.250
Apologize to everyone else for me.

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:01.630
Okay, got it.

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:02.380
Take care.

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:06.090
Chikura caught a cold, and won't be able to come.

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:07.300
Is that so?

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.720
I guess it can't be helped if it's a cold.

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:12.010
I'm going!

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:13.010
Huh?

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:14.560
To visit Chikura-san!

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:18.100
I'm the only one who can save her!

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:19.520
What's with him?

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:21.770
Sogabe-kun likes Chikura?

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:22.650
Yeah.

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:23.980
I didn't know that...

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:27.150
Wait, that means I'm alone with Kusuda?!

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:29.700
But we're in the middle of a cold war...

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:33.030
Maybe this is our chance to make amends!

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:35.990
I'll apologize properly today.

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:43.670
I hate this atmosphere.

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:45.590
I can't apologize like this.

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:48.380
What am I supposed to do?

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:48.920
Should we go home?

00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:50.340
What?

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:53.890
It's not a Christmas party with just the two of us.

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:55.350
Let's cancel it.

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:57.140
W-Wait a sec!

00:15:57.760 --> 00:16:00.430
Why don't we go eat dinner since we're already here?

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:02.480
I'm starving.

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:04.350
Why would I care about how hungry you are?

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:06.860
Even if I go home, there won't be dinner for me.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:08.980
Isn't it like that at your place too?

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:11.360
If you go home now there won't be anything to eat!

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:12.320
So...

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:25.670
Snow...

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:31.760
Let's get someting to eat then.

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:32.380
Huh?

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:34.590
Hey, wait for me.

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:38.890
I can't believe it.

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:41.680
What should I eat?

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:44.980
It's Christmas, so it should be hotel restaurant with a nice night view-

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:47.810
Well maybe not that, but what's with this place?

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:49.860
They don't have a Christmas menu!

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:51.490
And we're along the wall!

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:54.070
I shouldn't think about these things.

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:56.490
I have Kusuda right here in front of me, after all...

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:09.040
Waitress-san, your panties are being peeped at!

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:11.300
And I'd like to order.

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:15.260
I-I'm sorry. May I take your order?

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:16.840
I want meat spaghetti!

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:20.430
Hey, pick something a bit more Christmas-y!

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:21.720
What about you?

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:23.730
I would like the hamburg set and a shortcake please.

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:26.190
Is that a Christmas-y meal?

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:28.520
That's right! The shortcake part is.

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:29.770
Let me repeat your order.

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:35.030
Meat spaghetti, hamburger set, shortcake. Is that correct?

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:35.820
Yes.

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:37.280
It'll be ready in a few minutes.

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:42.450
Dang, she left.

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:44.960
She had some bouncy ones.

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:46.870
What's with that?

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.290
It's finally just the two of us, too.

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:06.730
I thought Christmas was the one day that everyone in the world could be happy.

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:17.360
I thought that....

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:21.240
Kusuda!

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:23.950
Why don't we stop at one more place?

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:27.620
Where is this one more place?

00:18:29.630 --> 00:18:31.500
Like karaoke or bowling?

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:34.250
All the karaoke places are full.

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:36.590
And the bowling alleys have a two hour wait.

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:41.970
H-Hey, Kusuda! Wait!

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:47.430
No...

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:52.900
Wait...

00:18:57.440 --> 00:19:00.450
I haven't apologized yet.

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:04.660
I can't go home feeling like this.

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:06.500
I don't want to go.

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:21.220
I'm the first to touch this park's snow!

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:23.890
Okay.

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:28.930
Look! A bunch piled up!

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:30.890
What're you doing?!

00:19:31.350 --> 00:19:31.980
What do you mean?!

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:34.560
You keep going off by yourself,

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:37.190
this doesn't feel like Christmas at all,

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:38.110
and you're perverted!

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:40.490
On top of that you aren't good looking!

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:42.110
H-Hey, wait a sec!

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:45.030
Why are you always so cold to...

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:47.700
me?!

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:54.170
You sure can talk.

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:57.000
You're always strict with me too!

00:19:57.340 --> 00:19:59.880
Even today you were annoying, saying you want to do this and that.

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:03.090
It's because you wouldn't listen to me.

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:07.430
Then you could just leave me alone!

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:18.280
You don't know how others feel.

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:25.570
I really just wanted to...

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:28.580
tell you that...

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:29.910
Snowball fight's over!

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:32.660
Let's go home.

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:37.960
I told you it's over!

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:46.850
This is?

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:51.430
It's a Christmas present!

00:20:52.180 --> 00:20:54.350
It's that flashy scarf.

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:58.320
There's no use keeping it.

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:00.400
Thanks...

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:03.280
Then, this is for you.

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:07.950
There's no use keeping it either.

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:10.240
T-Thank you.

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:14.660
W-What's this?!

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:16.210
It's very me isn't it?

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:20.420
I'm sorry.

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:27.010
I said some horrible things that time.

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:30.180
I really did think it was kind of nice.

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:33.560
Because those pink gloves...

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:35.690
seemed like they would really suit me!

00:21:36.730 --> 00:21:37.730
But still, I...

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:40.610
Man, I must be psychic.

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:48.030
These...

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:51.990
Actually, I bought these after that.

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:56.670
Look, I really do look good in pink!

00:21:56.670 --> 00:21:59.330
Doesn't any woman look good in pink?

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:03.130
You should put on the scarf that I got you too.

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:04.840
It's ok, I'll pass.

00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:08.430
Just do it.

00:22:09.090 --> 00:22:11.180
Idiot, are you trying to kill me?

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:12.720
You wrinkly-face.

00:22:12.720 --> 00:22:14.600
What? You kappa-face.

00:22:19.270 --> 00:22:28.200
The scenery I saw for the first time is spreading.

00:22:29.740 --> 00:22:38.830
The light that shone and the future without promise came to mind.

00:22:40.420 --> 00:22:45.420
Let's sort it out together.

00:22:45.960 --> 00:22:51.390
The flashing, shining illumination.

00:22:51.090 --> 00:23:01.480
A night of falling stars and the glowing light from the golden moon.

00:23:01.310 --> 00:23:04.190
some it's for you

00:23:03.730 --> 00:23:09.400
Reach the sky, a wish granted.

00:23:09.070 --> 00:23:12.450
Until the day it eventually arrives.

00:23:11.990 --> 00:23:17.250
If you wish Christmas night

00:23:12.280 --> 00:23:16.950
if you wish kurisumasu no yoru

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:23.840
We'll definitely meet. I wonder where we'll go.

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:28.090
At that illusionary place,

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:36.560
along the roads we individually take.

00:23:41.440 --> 00:23:44.520
Have you ever fallen in love?

00:23:46.320 --> 00:23:51.360
Enomoto, who realized that I'm dating Terai from the tennis club,

00:23:51.360 --> 00:23:53.410
is telling me to show affection...

00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:57.490
Well, I'm good at showing off my tennis skills.
